WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000 line:0
North–South play East–West; four cards make a trick.
Bid for trumps and a target, then play 13 tricks.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000 line:0
Weak hands may ask for a redeal; here both decline.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000 line:0
Pick a level and suit, then confirm: East bids 3♥.
Hearts are trumps; East–West need nine tricks.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.999 line:0
The other three pass: the contract is 3♥.

00:00:25.999 --> 00:00:39.999 line:0
North leads clubs; East must follow with a club.
The highest card of the led suit wins the trick.

00:00:39.999 --> 00:00:46.998 line:0
The trick winner leads the next trick.

00:00:46.998 --> 00:00:56.998 line:0
Out of clubs, East may discard another suit;
West trumps with a heart and wins.

00:00:56.998 --> 00:01:09.998 line:0
Fast-forward through the remaining tricks;
the table counts each team’s tricks.

00:01:09.998 --> 00:01:19.000 line:0
East–West take nine tricks and make 3♥:
declarer’s side wins.
